


## Ajout d'un auteur
POST http://localhost:8080/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Martin Fowler",
  "email": "martin.fowler@eni.fr"
}
> {% client.global.set("authorId", response.body.id); %}
#########

## Ajout d'un livre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title" : "1984"
}
> {% client.global.set("id", response.body.id); %}
#########

## Affecter un auteur au livre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/{{id}}/authors/{{authorId}}
Content-Type: application/json
#########


## Emprunt d'un livre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/{{id}}/borrow
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "email" : "sly@mail.com"
}

#########

## Retour d'un livre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/{{id}}/return
Content-Type: application/json

#########